(之)子楙尚太祖女清河公主　按據《魏志．諸夏侯曹傳》，夏侯楙為夏侯惇之子，即夏侯淵族子，此處「之」字改為「族」。〕，文帝少與之親善，及即位，以為安西將軍，都督關中，鎮長安，使承淵處。\n\n諸葛亮將入寇，與群下謀之，丞相司馬","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":2,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:sanguozhi-344e057bf04afb24","bookId":"book:sanguozhi","requestedTitle":"三國志/卷40","title":"三國志/卷40","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B740","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2583390","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B740?action=history","revisionId":2583390,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-07-29T13:34:22Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:40:04.513Z","sha256":"fad89d76fad0c0a1571c60e4781e682dc122cfada755f759d9f74707adf63e7b","textSha256":"bcc6ffcc39767718b60bbcc360ab092a81c944df31d1f68d230fc2d56598af60","expandedWikitextSha256":"fad89d76fad0c0a1571c60e4781e682dc122cfada755f759d9f74707adf63e7b","characters":8798,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/sanguozhi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:36.643Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/b54580d6e33e2a0876ba.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/b54580d6e33e2a0876ba.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:zizhitongjian-355b8b5d8dbf81c8","bookId":"bo